/P 106 0 R
/E (Our services cover the implementation and advisory of internationally recognized standards such as ISO/IEC 27001:2022Information Security Management System \(ISMS\) and ISO 22301:2019 Business Continuity Management System \(BCMS\), as well as Cyber Security Audit services. These initiatives help organizations establish effective policies, processes, and controls to protect the Confidentiality, Integrity, and Availability \(CIA\) of information assets, ensure continuity of critical services, and assess the effectiveness of existing cybersecurity controls. Through these services, organizations can improve governance practices, strengthen compliance, and enhance stakeholder confidence.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3 4]
>>
